{"h":3106,"lines":[{"x":0.16917293252042059,"c":1,"h":0.017500823954958666,"y":0.068254990096986989,"t":"Test 3","w":0.060150375366210956},{"c":1,"h":0.017441860722175129,"y":0.11918604636947205,"t":"READING","x":0.49624060360872285,"w":0.12781954447428384},{"w":0.25406384785970049,"c":1,"h":0.020883129092853392,"x":0.16903406129207763,"t":"READING PASSAGE 1","y":0.16268642516723797},{"y":0.20203488340264897,"t":"You should spend about 20 minutes on Questions 1-13, which are based on Reading","w":0.76879699707031246,"h":0.021802326209761524,"c":1,"x":0.1710526291405885},{"w":0.1616541290283203,"h":0.020381594656055713,"c":1,"x":0.16917293533472674,"y":0.2194767443231882,"t":"Passage 1 below."},{"c":1,"h":0.021802326209761524,"x":0.44548871845067645,"y":0.26162790665282798,"w":0.23496241251627598,"t":"The coconut palm"},{"c":1,"h":0.021086686055121429,"x":0.16721529902315846,"y":0.30068206729865721,"t":"For millennia, the coconut has been central to the lives of Polynesian and Asian peoples.","w":0.78963500976562495},{"x":0.16720118674344234,"t":"In the western world, on the other hand, coconuts have always been exotic and unusual,","w":0.78967188517252607,"c":1,"h":0.021472228394733728,"y":0.31868213308895954},{"c":1,"x":0.16721639578627426,"h":0.019313397134263832,"y":0.33755219722531893,"t":"sometimes rare. The Italian merchant traveller Marco Polo apparently saw coconuts","w":0.74451675415039065},{"w":0.75770126342773425,"c":1,"h":0.021057305762787637,"x":0.16531859809538607,"t":"in South Asia in the late 13th century, and among the mid-14th-century travel writings","y":0.35559854550132264},{"c":1,"x":0.16729324295058945,"w":0.75187967936197908,"t":"of Sir John Mandeville there is mention of 'great Notes of Ynde' (great Nuts of India).","y":0.37347070202114518,"h":0.01899549259497757},{"w":0.76910079956054678,"x":0.1671536666991284,"y":0.39117020530791247,"t":"Today, images of palm-fringed tropical beaches are clichés in the west to sell holidays,","h":0.021748733766141948,"c":1},{"t":"chocolate bars, fizzy drinks and even romance.","x":0.16729323214675437,"y":0.41133720916634242,"w":0.42293233235677075,"h":0.017510183227499754,"c":1},{"t":"Typically, we envisage coconuts as brown cannonballs that, when opened, provide","y":0.44643474381563242,"w":0.733260243733724,"c":1,"x":0.16719821232309187,"h":0.020441282509375713},{"w":0.78218877156575528,"x":0.16718439633125418,"h":0.021064350548208099,"c":1,"y":0.46445372490076176,"t":"sweet white flesh. But we see only part of the fruit and none of the plant from which they"},{"y":0.48377450325318605,"t":"come. The coconut palm has a smooth, slender, grey trunk, up to 30 metres tall. This","w":0.75391474405924475,"h":0.020458174765071613,"c":1,"x":0.16721260773089738},{"t":"is an important source of timber for building houses, and is increasingly being used as","x":0.16530125076351132,"y":0.50039896987675803,"h":0.021784275789377583,"w":0.76525599161783853,"c":1},{"w":0.74086639404296895,"h":0.021508734531734186,"c":1,"y":0.51808689027335597,"x":0.16717075632713535,"t":"a replacement for endangered hardwoods in the furniture construction industry. The"},{"t":"trunk is surmounted by a rosette of leaves, each of which may be up to six metres long.","x":0.16531441388244816,"y":0.53757620576189347,"h":0.022051357409298533,"c":1,"w":0.77839482625325507},{"t":"The leaves have hard veins in their centres which, in many parts of the world, are used","h":0.021072831064827269,"x":0.16533355420373122,"y":0.55622624023005196,"w":0.77269673665364591,"c":1},{"x":0.16531651105634354,"h":0.020143476978702335,"c":1,"t":"as brushes after the green part of the leaf has been stripped away. Immature coconut","w":0.75960530598958331,"y":0.57415482214984037},{"h":0.019376371571577011,"t":"flowers are tightly clustered together among the leaves at the top of the trunk. The flower","w":0.78960871378580744,"x":0.16534246120543827,"y":0.59283903273050609,"c":1},{"t":"stems may be tapped for their sap to produce a drink, and the sap can also be reduced","x":0.16533878833587437,"h":0.019401320625103802,"c":1,"w":0.77458470662434897,"y":0.61101673864728567},{"y":0.62919720199330442,"c":1,"h":0.019385183080119384,"w":0.48518915812174479,"t":"by boiling to produce a type of sugar used for cooking.","x":0.16529956692629541},{"c":1,"t":"Coconut palms produce as many as seventy fruits per year, weighing more than a","y":0.66565815788574534,"h":0.020927173739775373,"x":0.16346303014764449,"w":0.72757659912109374},{"t":"kilogram each. The wall of the fruit has three layers: a waterproof outer layer, a fibrous","y":0.68387205801262019,"x":0.16346238900954102,"w":0.76706202189127604,"c":1,"h":0.019971051679759766},{"y":0.70347714095226066,"h":0.017453091726407521,"c":1,"x":0.16353382871794944,"t":"middle layer and a hard, inner layer. The thick fibrous middle layer produces coconut","w":0.7537594095865886},{"y":0.71928905599891746,"t":"fibre, 'coir', which has numerous uses and is particularly important in manufacturing","x":0.16344821347964342,"w":0.74265691121419264,"h":0.021354073489472158,"c":1},{"x":0.16342472445266273,"t":"ropes. The woody innermost layer, the shell, with its three prominent 'eyes', surrounds","y":0.73707745545554837,"w":0.76525009155273438,"h":0.022253107732906674,"c":1},{"h":0.020122272616728387,"y":0.75680003790594352,"w":0.7783816528320312,"c":1,"t":"the seed. An important product obtained from the shell is charcoal, which is widely used","x":0.16343510083671134},{"y":0.77467153018927182,"h":0.022014089806649428,"c":1,"t":"in various industries as well as in the home as a cooking fuel. When broken in half, the","x":0.16154641906439376,"w":0.77088139851888027},{"t":"shells are also used as bowls in many parts of Asia.","y":0.79360465094087984,"w":0.46240600585937491,"x":0.16353384429775591,"c":1,"h":0.019016082871750828},{"x":0.16155105862956495,"t":"Inside the shell are the nutrients (endosperm) needed by the developing seed. Initially,","c":1,"h":0.021235147293198864,"y":0.82936695914521108,"w":0.77089502970377599},{"t":"the endosperm is a sweetish liquid, coconut water, which is enjoyed as a drink, but also","y":0.84779627627132481,"x":0.16156984582632161,"h":0.021095060949086086,"w":0.77648366292317705,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.020903354603017621,"y":0.86609165421114542,"w":0.77836695353190111,"x":0.16344242923891764,"t":"provides the hormones which encourage other plants to grow more rapidly and produce"},{"t":"higher yields. As the fruit matures, the coconut water gradually solidifies to form the","w":0.73890981038411452,"h":0.02125972052658287,"c":1,"y":0.8844512016306576,"x":0.16343248463293},{"c":1,"t":"brilliant white, fat-rich, edible flesh or meat. Dried coconut flesh, 'copra', is made into","y":0.90221839192852837,"w":0.74827529907226564,"h":0.021315890899874401,"x":0.16344879126402417},{"w":0.76315790812174478,"x":0.16165412853662475,"c":1,"y":0.92296511614752252,"h":0.017472746137335293,"t":"coconut oil and coconut milk, which are widely used in cooking in different parts of the"},{"w":0.76706441243489587,"h":0.020662296685724169,"x":0.16158466938709692,"c":1,"t":"world, as well as in cosmetics. A derivative of coconut fat, glycerine, acquired strategic","y":0.93949034516282115},{"t":"60","x":0.16165413536984435,"y":0.96802325594121386,"w":0.026315789222717295,"h":0.014534883321060788,"c":1}],"w":2400}